e, des sels pharmaceutiquement acceptable et des hydrates de ce dernier). L'invention concerne la formule (I) dans laquelle R&lt;1&gt; représente (II) ou analogue, et R&lt;2&gt; représente (III), où A est un noyau benzénique ou un hétérocycle, ou analogue.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>